CORE
negative-part-select-width1.sv
--bound 1
^file .* line 8: width of indexed part select must be positive$
^EXIT=2$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^\[main\.p0\]
--
1800-2017 11.5.1: the width expr2 of an indexed part-select
"expr1 +: expr2" / "expr1 -: expr2" shall be a positive constant
expression.  A negative width is illegal; EBMC correctly rejects it
during type-checking.
